desc:Breath (inhale/exhale) watcher — fire when koru's pass-rate sits in a SUSTAINED deep inhale (a long fall below its own peak that won't exhale), past anything the in-sample bring-up ever showed
author:WMFX
tags:world-model dogfood breath inhale-exhale pass-rate sustained-drawdown koru regression-suite

// --- Port units (WMFX annotations) ---
@unit pass_rate     percent
@unit peak          percent
@unit drawdown      percent
@unit depth_floor   percent
@unit dip_ticks     1
@unit dur_threshold 1
@unit alarm         1
@unit surprise      1

// Breath = the pass-rate trajectory over the regression snapshots. Inhale = the
// rate FALLING (we outpace the suite on purpose); exhale = the rate RISING (we
// prune lies and fix). A healthy breath oscillates. The pathology is an inhale
// held too long: the rate sits deep below its own peak for many snapshots and
// won't exhale.
//
// Why this MUST be stateful (not a snapshot subtraction): a single-tick crash is
// a mid-run snapshot artifact, NOT a breath. Only by carrying a peak and a
// run-length counter ACROSS ticks can the model tell a deep-for-weeks inhale from
// one-tick noise. `peak` and `dip_ticks` below persist tick-to-tick — that carried
// state is what turns a pass-rate stream into a breath.
//
// Constants are DESIGN CONSTANTS (not tunables), frozen BEFORE replay:
//   depth_floor   = 8   — a real inhale is >= 8 points below the best-ever rate;
//                         normal oscillation is shallower.
//   dur_threshold = 18  — 1.5x the longest in-sample (Jan–Apr bring-up) sustained
//                         dip run (12 ticks). Sits above normal breathing, so an
//                         active dev breath never trips it; a real stall does.
@init
peak = 0;
dip_ticks = 0;
depth_floor = 8;
dur_threshold = 18;

@block
// High-water peak of the breath so far — the ceiling the rate oscillates under.
peak = pass_rate > peak ? pass_rate : peak;
// How deep the current inhale is: points below the best-ever rate.
drawdown = peak - pass_rate;
// Sustained-inhale counter: +1 each consecutive tick we stay deep; resets the
// instant the breath exhales back above the floor. THIS is the carried state.
dip_ticks = drawdown >= depth_floor ? dip_ticks + 1 : 0;
// Fire when the inhale has been held longer than any in-sample breath ever was.
alarm = dip_ticks >= dur_threshold ? 1 : 0;
surprise = dip_ticks;
